    "name": "PlanetScale Platform Backups Billing API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The PlanetScale Platform API provides programmatic access to manage PlanetScale serverless MySQL-compatible databases. It allows developers to create and manage databases, branches, deploy requests, passwords, backups, service tokens, organization members, teams, bouncers, and billing data. The API supports authentication via service tokens and OAuth, enabling integration into CI/CD pipelines and infrastructure-as-code workflows.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: PlanetScale Support",
